{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive your car off jumps, through loops, and over pits to reach the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Do you remember the secret area of San Francisco Rush on track six for the N64? It had loops and hips and jumps to go off of. We wanted to capture some of that feeling of playing with car physics with this game.\u00a0 <br>If you rollover hit the reset button. Feel free to change to any level in the game and clear them in funny ways.\u00a0<br>We aim to support modern controllers like the Dualsense, Dualshock 4, Xbox controller and keyboard.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reverse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272600/073cdda07f2426649e1ad7e13ad9b97dbb002c40.jpg"},{"name":"Final Level","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272600/84164239407fd55b729b4940f83aa5ff36e28214.jpg"},{"name":"Do a loop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272600/dfe1876024cf452981a07d42584d36de51494886.jpg"},{"name":"Paint job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272600/ae28b51df4dfbd28a61616eac90742f0769eecd3.jpg"},{"name":"Companion Cube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272600/8e28faa0e3920eeb26c70bc275c425dd0202bdf0.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272600?t=1741075284","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272600?t=1741075284","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272600/844ec09f8407b2bf1b26a864c7afa157b4004627/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741075284","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272600/844ec09f8407b2bf1b26a864c7afa157b4004627/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741075284","categories